# KubeDock Web is embedded in the desktop KubeDock application.
# SSH credentials and the web login are NOT configured here.
#
# SSH access is inherited from the VM connection already established by
# KubeDock, and web login credentials are stored in KubeDock Settings.
#
# Optional web-server settings:
# Default: 127.0.0.1 (loopback only). When WEBAPP_TLS_CERTFILE and
# WEBAPP_TLS_KEYFILE are both set, the default becomes 0.0.0.0 so devices on
# your LAN can reach the app over HTTPS. Uncomment to override explicitly.
# WEBAPP_HOST=127.0.0.1
WEBAPP_PORT=8000
# WEBAPP_TLS_CERTFILE=/path/to/cert.pem
# WEBAPP_TLS_KEYFILE=/path/to/key.pem
